// CHARACTERIZATION — current behaviour is incorrect, fixed in PR3.
//
// The primary key moves from `id` to `code`. `diffTable` never inspects
// `table.primaryKey` at all, and neither column's type/nullable/default/
// unique flag changes, so `columnSignature` matches on both sides and the
// diff emits ZERO DDL — the database keeps the old primary key forever.
// PR3 detects a primary-key-column-set change and emits
// `DROP CONSTRAINT ... ` then `ADD PRIMARY KEY (...)`.

Table Item {
  id   Int
  code String @unique @id
}
